# Keeps ripgrep (and so Claude Code's Grep/Glob) out of graphify's bulk output.
# These files are machine artifacts: a match in them is never the answer, but
# scanning them pollutes every repo-wide search. Query them instead:
#   node scripts/graph-query.mjs help
#
# Not a .gitignore — git still tracks all of this.
graph.json
graph.html
manifest.json
cache/
